      "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053'. PMDco 'has characteristic': Inverse of characteristic_of Flattened: in PMDco the bearer has a characteristic (an instance of a quality/property class), whose value is given by a scalar value specification (has value specification / specifies value of) with a number and a unit. Here each item gives the characteristic class, the number and the unit. Typical uses: device qualities such as mass or dimensions."
